1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,531
The finished voltmeter has a very large resistance, G plus R.

2
00:00:04,531 --> 00:00:10,546
It goes in parallel across the thing being measured, and must draw as little current as possible.

3
00:00:10,546 --> 00:00:13,893
An ideal voltmeter has infinite resistance.

